*.p12
*.p8
*.mobileprovision
*.cer

# CocoaPods
**/ios/**/Pods/
**/ios/**/.symlinks/

# Xcode user data
**/ios/**/*.pbxuser
**/ios/**/*.mode1v3
**/ios/**/*.mode2v3
**/ios/**/*.perspectivev3
**/ios/**/xcuserdata
**/ios/**/*.moved-aside
**/ios/**/*sync/
**/ios/**/.sconsign.dblite
**/ios/**/.tags*
**/ios/**/.vagrant/
**/ios/**/DerivedData/
**/ios/**/Icon?
**/ios/**/profile
**/ios/.generated/

# Flutter iOS build artifacts
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
**/ios/Flutter/App.framework
**/ios/Flutter/Flutter.framework
**/ios/Flutter/Flutter.podspec
**/ios/Flutter/Generated.xcconfig
**/ios/Flutter/app.flx
**/ios/Flutter/app.zip
**/ios/Flutter/flutter_assets/
**/ios/Flutter/flutter_export_environment.sh
**/ios/ServiceDefinitions.json
**/ios/Runner/GeneratedPluginRegistrant.*

# Exceções — manter esses arquivos Xcode padrão
!**/ios/**/default.mode1v3
!**/ios/**/default.mode2v3
!**/ios/**/default.pbxuser
!**/ios/**/default.perspectivev3

